{
  "id": "749",
  "title": "Completely Unexpected",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-11-08",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming has caught a cold, and his Mom wants him to take some medicine.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/749/4755becf5f27360fb91a6d94fb6528f5c8af6da7.mp3?1572261409",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "万万没想到\n\n    小明感冒了，妈妈要小明吃药，小明不肯吃。不管妈妈怎么劝，小明还是不肯吃药。\n    妈妈没办法了，只好对小明说：“小明乖！只要你肯乖乖吃药，我奖励你100元，好不好？”\n    小明想了想，说：“不好！除非吃一颗，100元。”\n    妈妈想，感冒药嘛，顶多也就两颗，200元，不算多，也就同意了。\n    万万没想到，小明拿出了一包感冒颗粒冲剂，一颗一颗地数着吃……",
    "traditional": "萬萬沒想到\n\n    小明感冒了，媽媽要小明吃藥，小明不肯吃。不管媽媽怎麼勸，小明還是不肯吃藥。\n    媽媽沒辦法了，只好對小明說：“小明乖！只要你肯乖乖吃藥，我獎勵你100元，好不好？”\n    小明想了想，說：“不好！除非吃一顆，100元。”\n    媽媽想，感冒藥嘛，頂多也就兩顆，200元，不算多，也就同意了。\n    萬萬沒想到，小明拿出了一包感冒顆粒沖劑，一顆一顆地數著吃……"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Completely Unexpected"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明感冒了，妈妈要小明吃药，小明不肯吃。",
      "traditional": "小明感冒了，媽媽要小明吃藥，小明不肯吃。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng gǎn mào le mā ma yào xiǎo míng chī yào xiǎo míng bù kěn chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "不管妈妈怎么劝，小明还是不肯吃药。",
      "traditional": "不管媽媽怎麼勸，小明還是不肯吃藥。",
      "pinyin": "bù guǎn mā ma zěn me quàn xiǎo míng hái shì bù kěn chī yào",
      "english": "Little Ming has caught a cold, and Mom wants him to take medicine, but Little Ming doesn’t agree to take it."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "No matter how Mom tries to persuade him, Little Ming still doesn’t agree to take the medicine."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "妈妈没办法了，只好对小明说：",
      "traditional": "媽媽沒辦法了，只好對小明說：",
      "pinyin": "mā ma méi bàn fǎ le zhǐ hǎo duì xiǎo míng shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“小明乖！只要你肯乖乖吃药，",
      "traditional": "“小明乖！只要你肯乖乖吃藥，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng guāi zhǐ yào nǐ kěn guāi guāi chī yào",
      "english": "Mom has no choice but to say to Little Ming:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我奖励你100元，好不好？”",
      "traditional": "我獎勵你100元，好不好？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jiǎng lì nǐ 2 yuán hǎo bù hǎo",
      "english": "“Good Little Ming! If you only agree to behave and take the medicine,” .."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. “I'll reward you with 100 yuan, wouldn’t that be nice?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小明想了想，说：“不好！除非吃一颗，100元。”",
      "traditional": "小明想了想，說：“不好！除非吃一顆，100元。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎng le xiǎng shuō bù hǎo chú fēi chī yì kē 2 yuán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming thought about it, and said: \"No! Only if it’s 100 yuan to eat one pill.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "妈妈想，感冒药嘛，顶多也就两颗，200元，不算多，也就同意了。",
      "traditional": "媽媽想，感冒藥嘛，頂多也就兩顆，200元，不算多，也就同意了。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma xiǎng gǎn mào yào ma dǐng duō yě jiù liǎng kē 2 yuán bú suàn duō yě jiù tóng yì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom thought that it would be at most two pills for cold medicine, and 200 yuan wasn’t that much, so she consented."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "万万没想到，小明拿出了一包感冒颗粒冲剂，",
      "traditional": "萬萬沒想到，小明拿出了一包感冒顆粒沖劑，",
      "pinyin": "wàn wàn méi xiǎng dào xiǎo míng ná chū le yì bāo gǎn mào kē lì chōng jì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "一颗一颗地数着吃……",
      "traditional": "一顆一顆地數著吃……",
      "pinyin": "yì kē yì kē de shǔ zhe chī",
      "english": "Completely unexpectedly, Little Ming took out a packet of granulated cold medicine, .."
    }
  ],
