    "sentence_translations": [
      "Completely Unexpected",
      "",
      "Little Ming has caught a cold, and Mom wants him to take medicine, but Little Ming doesn’t agree to take it.",
      "No matter how Mom tries to persuade him, Little Ming still doesn’t agree to take the medicine.",
      "",
      "Mom has no choice but to say to Little Ming:",
      "“Good Little Ming! If you only agree to behave and take the medicine,” ..",
      ".. “I'll reward you with 100 yuan, wouldn’t that be nice?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming thought about it, and said: \"No! Only if it’s 100 yuan to eat one pill.”",
      "",
      "Mom thought that it would be at most two pills for cold medicine, and 200 yuan wasn’t that much, so she consented.",
      "",
      "Completely unexpectedly, Little Ming took out a packet of granulated cold medicine, ..",
      ".. and counted as he ate them one by one…"
    ]
